# Plain English

Write every user-facing reply in plain English, the way you would explain it to a smart kid.

- Short sentences. Everyday words.
- Say what something does before you name the file or function.
- If you need a technical word, explain it in the same sentence.
- Lead with the answer. Put the details after that.
- Stay accurate. Simple wording still has to be true.
